            "text": "🚀 GDG Aktobe | Build with AI — Online Workshop\nЭффективное масштабирование RAG (Retrieval- Augmented Generation)\n\n📅 28.02 (сб) | ⏰ 14:00 | 🌐 Онлайн (на русском)\n🔗 Ссылка на встречу: https://meet.google.com/cfj-qrst-crn\n\n🎤 Джелал Султанов\nIntern @BMW Group\nMSc AI Engineering, University of Passau (Germany)\n\n📌 Как масштабировать RAG-системы для миллионов документов:\nметаданные, pre-filtering, гибридный поиск (BM25 + embeddings), многоэтапный retrieval, latency и production-архитектура.\n\n✅ Регистрация обязательна: https://gdg.community.dev/events/details/google-gdg-aktobe-presents-workshop-designing-scalable-rag-systems-for-millions-of-documents/\nили по телефону 📞 +7 775 721 62 91\n\n💬 Ждём вас онлайн — будет интересно и полезно!\n\n🚀 GDG Aktobe | Build with AI — Online Workshop\nEfficient RAG: Scaling Retrieval-Augmented Generation\n\n📅 Feb 28 | ⏰ 2 PM | 🌐 Online\n🔗 Meeting link: https://meet.google.com/cfj-qrst-crn\n\n🎤 Jelal Sultanov\nIntern @BMW Group\nMSc AI Engineering, University of Passau (Germany)\n\n📌 How to build scalable RAG systems for millions of documents:\nmetadata, pre-filtering, hybrid search (BM25 + embeddings), multi-stage retrieval, latency & production architectures.\n\n✅ Registration required: https://gdg.community.dev/events/details/google-gdg-aktobe-presents-workshop-designing-scalable-rag-systems-for-millions-of-documents/\nor call 📞 +7 775 721 62 91\n\n💬 Looking forward to seeing you online — it’s going to be fun and informative!"
